    "description": "Hybrid polymer sealants sit between latex and silicone: more flexible and weatherproof than acrylic, but paintable, which silicone usually is not. Gorilla's Ultimate Sealant Window & Door is the fastest-painting hybrid we found published figures for. Gorilla says it is the only paintable formula in its Ultimate line, ready for paint in 30 minutes and water in 15, and describes it as a smooth, tack-free hybrid that forms a 100% waterproof seal with lifetime mould resistance. Those times are for a 3/16 inch bead at 70 degrees F and 50% humidity, so a thicker bead or a cold morning will take longer. Where it earns its price over Alex Plus is outside: exterior door and window casings, trim boards and the seam where trim meets siding, where water exposure and movement are real but you still want to paint the same day. For interior trim, it is more sealant than you need. Note the cartridge is 9 oz, not 10.1."
  },
  {
    "id": "ge-supreme-paintable-silicone-2733730",
    "name": "GE Supreme Paintable Silicone Window & Door 2733730, 9.5 oz",
