          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What caulk is best for painting trim?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A siliconized acrylic latex made for trim. DAP Alex Flex is the best fit because it combines a 30-minute paint time with a C920 movement rating. DAP Alex Plus is the value choice for joints that barely move, and Alex Fast Dry suits jobs where you caulk and paint on the same visit. Economy painter's caulk is fine only on static joints."
          }
