            For interior trim, buy DAP Alex Flex: 30 minutes to paint and a C920 Class 12.5 movement rating for the joints that open up every winter. Use Alex Plus where nothing moves, Alex Fast Dry when you caulk and paint on one visit, and White Lightning only for static gaps on a big repaint. Outside, Sashco Big Stretch is the paintable acrylic for high-movement trim if you can wait to paint, and Gorilla Ultimate is the hybrid if you cannot.
